<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/05b19f8b-f760-4d3b-a9c8-26a5c16da4f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/05b19f8b-f760-4d3b-a9c8-26a5c16da4f2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delete a regularity witness and classify the projected RBox — rejected: a witness is not a removal set, the choice among alternative deletions is not local, and deleting a hierarchy edge can silently strip an inherited range so that range elimination then runs outside its own precondition." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/05b19f8b-f760-4d3b-a9c8-26a5c16da4f2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
