<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/05b19f8b-f760-4d3b-a9c8-26a5c16da4f2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Delete a regularity witness and classify the projected RBox — rejected: a witness is not a removal set, the choice among alternative deletions is not local, and deleting a hierarchy edge can silently strip an inherited range so that range elimination then runs outside its own precondition." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/0d5df47e-4bec-45a3-a099-128109f7008c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/0d5df47e-4bec-45a3-a099-128109f7008c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In-place insertion sort now that list-set exists — rejected: O(n) allocation but O(n^2) comparisons, which is ~5.4 billion for GO's 73,634 subsumptions and cannot meet the within-5x-ELK budget. list-set removes its allocation objection but not its time objection." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/0d5df47e-4bec-45a3-a099-128109f7008c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/0d5df47e-4bec-45a3-a099-128109f7008c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/0d5df47e-4bec-45a3-a099-128109f7008c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-12T05:01:39.400742Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/0d5df47e-4bec-45a3-a099-128109f7008c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "In-place insertion sort now that list-set exists — rejected: O(n) allocation but O(n^2) comparisons, which is ~5.4 billion for GO's 73,634 subsumptions and cannot meet the within-5x-ELK budget. list-set removes its allocation objection but not its time objection." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/21178e13-9446-43b1-962f-d7da2ab581e0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/21178e13-9446-43b1-962f-d7da2ab581e0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Defer ABox support to a later version — rejected: it is precisely what lifts the first consumer's instance-bearing ceiling, and it costs roughly nine lines in normalization rather than a data-model change." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/21178e13-9446-43b1-962f-d7da2ab581e0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/21178e13-9446-43b1-962f-d7da2ab581e0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/21178e13-9446-43b1-962f-d7da2ab581e0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-17T22:28:14.476821Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/21178e13-9446-43b1-962f-d7da2ab581e0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Defer ABox support to a later version — rejected: it is precisely what lifts the first consumer's instance-bearing ceiling, and it costs roughly nine lines in normalization rather than a data-model change." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Two-generation contexts, a `pending` set beside `subsumers` — rejected: `pending` is another `slop_map*` in the same record, so it has IDENTICAL aliasing character; it adds a hazard rather than removing one. Worse, it survives into `Outcome.saturation`, where `extract-findings` can read the uncommitted generation by mistake — a silent over-report of subsumers that were never committed." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-20T04:37:40.558096Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Two-generation contexts, a `pending` set beside `subsumers` — rejected: `pending` is another `slop_map*` in the same record, so it has IDENTICAL aliasing character; it adds a hazard rather than removing one. Worse, it survives into `Outcome.saturation`, where `extract-findings` can read the uncommitted generation by mistake — a silent over-report of subsumers that were never committed." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Leave the fallback profile unspecified when nothing contains the whole ontology — rejected: two conforming implementations would then classify different sub-theories of the same input and return different, equally sound, irreproducible findings." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
