<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-17T22:28:39.964513Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Leave the fallback profile unspecified when nothing contains the whole ontology — rejected: two conforming implementations would then classify different sub-theories of the same input and return different, equally sound, irreproducible findings." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In-place quicksort — rejected: not stable, so ties would resolve by pivot choice, which is a function of input order and therefore a direct §6.8 determinism violation. Its worst case is also adversarial-input-sensitive on a tool that ingests third-party ontologies." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-12T05:01:39.400742Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "In-place quicksort — rejected: not stable, so ties would resolve by pivot choice, which is a function of input order and therefore a direct §6.8 determinism violation. Its worst case is also adversarial-input-sensitive on a tool that ingests third-party ontologies." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wait for the sort builtin proposed in slop-lang/slop#121 — rejected for now: it is designed but unshipped as of 0.2.3, and the maintainer's own ordering puts the strlib.compare NUL fix ahead of it. HOWL's sort is two small functions and can be deleted in favour of the builtin when it lands." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-12T05:01:39.400742Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Wait for the sort builtin proposed in slop-lang/slop#121 — rejected for now: it is designed but unshipped as of 0.2.3, and the maintainer's own ordering puts the strlib.compare NUL fix ahead of it. HOWL's sort is two small functions and can be deleted in favour of the builtin when it lands." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/44387c61-f4c6-4c53-977f-572bec989213> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/44387c61-f4c6-4c53-977f-572bec989213> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "One hand-written sort per element type — rejected: SLOP has no generics, so this multiplies the algorithm by the number of sorted types and guarantees the copies drift. Sorting an index permutation under a supplied comparator reduces each type to a six-line gather." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/44387c61-f4c6-4c53-977f-572bec989213> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/44387c61-f4c6-4c53-977f-572bec989213> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
