<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/456ce203-67b5-4e11-bed8-e4c2ebaa791d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Import strlib.compare — rejected: implemented as strcmp over (. a data), so it assumes NUL termination that IRI slices out of a parsed Turtle buffer do not have. It would order entries by the bytes that happen to follow them in the file, making the sort a function of serialization rather than content." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/497f92ab-4a5d-4837-9125-de975c760f04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/497f92ab-4a5d-4837-9125-de975c760f04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Single-threaded deterministic mode for the port seam — rejected: sacrifices the context-parallelism that is HOWL's performance story; held in reserve if barrier cost proves prohibitive." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
