<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/554d13dc-2a8c-4245-8d20-01c519c8a5b2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
