<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/73f4c2dc-b853-4a94-8db2-56ac1828755b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
