<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/73f4c2dc-b853-4a94-8db2-56ac1828755b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Silently rewrite the 6 chain-shaped rules into owl:propertyChainAxiom to enlarge coverage — rejected: transforming input breaks §6.8's input-determined reports and decides a modelling question that belongs to the ontology's owner. Report the equivalence as a lint instead." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/74f97c80-21e0-479b-9f9c-066371cfb4a7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/74f97c80-21e0-479b-9f9c-066371cfb4a7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Insertion sort — rejected: with no list-set in the language every sort must rebuild, making insertion sort O(n^2) in allocation as well as time. Adequate for an omission list, unusable for GO's 73,634 subsumptions." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
