<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/74f97c80-21e0-479b-9f9c-066371cfb4a7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Insertion sort — rejected: with no list-set in the language every sort must rebuild, making insertion sort O(n^2) in allocation as well as time. Adequate for an omission list, unusable for GO's 73,634 subsumptions." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/7cd6ed15-6361-4814-ac41-aaa3c98f0059> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/7cd6ed15-6361-4814-ac41-aaa3c98f0059> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Refactor GROWL now to extract the shared substrate ahead of HOWL work — rejected as a speculative refactor; the extraction happens when HOWL work starts, driven by what is actually shared." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
