<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c1d27fb5-f0ea-44de-9390-5023bd08ac9d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Encode r(a,b) as the GCI individual(a) ⊑ ∃r.individual(b) — rejected: individual(b) is not a singleton, so two assertions naming the same b may be witnessed by different members and the identity of a repeated individual name is lost, returning a confident 'coherent' on a demonstrably inconsistent ontology." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
