<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c5ccd434-03f4-4796-8cb7-938a82ec5f08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c5ccd434-03f4-4796-8cb7-938a82ec5f08> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Classify each axiom under whichever profile contains it (a union calculus) — rejected: no published completeness proof covers the union, and the result would be a theory no single calculus is complete for." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
