<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/d3ea0cfc-9b85-43d8-bb2b-699c35a3465f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
