<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ee78df44-5919-46d5-8785-4add9ce54669> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ee78df44-5919-46d5-8785-4add9ce54669> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Keep the recursive top-down merge — rejected: it allocates a fresh list at every level, and under -DSLOP_ARENA_NO_CAP that memory is retained rather than reclaimed, so ~2n·log2(n) index slots survive to the end of the run against this form's 2n. It was the right choice only while list-set did not exist." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ee78df44-5919-46d5-8785-4add9ce54669> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
