<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/17beb51b-607b-4ff3-99de-b2afbb9dc801> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/39de5a2d-f88b-4ead-815a-b7e172eeb3fa> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
