<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0adb1a18-f9a2-46e6-97c9-d9dfd59bb444> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
