<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/16d7a32b-bcda-48d9-9c45-9aaad4cc5176> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/16d7a32b-bcda-48d9-9c45-9aaad4cc5176> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A (List T) passed by value can now be mutated by its callee through list-set, which is new in this codebase and easy to misread as pass-by-reference. It holds only for length-preserving writes; list-push through the same parameter would grow the callee's copy and lose it on return." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/16d7a32b-bcda-48d9-9c45-9aaad4cc5176> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
