<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/1a1499bc-7d94-46f4-8361-61af5cc2a9b5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/1a1499bc-7d94-46f4-8361-61af5cc2a9b5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Agreement with GROWL on the EL-intersect-RL overlap becomes a standing production correctness obligation, not just a CI check — and disagreement is an engine fault that may never be resolved by preferring one engine." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
