<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6db03a02-b135-48eb-b409-f484614cc58a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Ontologies carrying SWRL rules — including RO, a mainstream OBO ontology — report INCONCLUSIVE rather than coherent. Honest, and the verdict rule's intended behaviour, but it means a real fraction of the OBO ecosystem cannot reach exit 0 without the rules being removed or rewritten upstream." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7320fd0d-45bf-420f-80be-dbe128ad10d7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7320fd0d-45bf-420f-80be-dbe128ad10d7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The DisjointClasses(C,D)/range(r)=C/range(s)=D/r(a,b)/s(c,b) fixture becomes a MANDATORY regression test: it is the smallest case distinguishing the two encodings, and the rejected one passes every fixture that lacks it." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7320fd0d-45bf-420f-80be-dbe128ad10d7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
