<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7320fd0d-45bf-420f-80be-dbe128ad10d7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The DisjointClasses(C,D)/range(r)=C/range(s)=D/r(a,b)/s(c,b) fixture becomes a MANDATORY regression test: it is the smallest case distinguishing the two encodings, and the rejected one passes every fixture that lacks it." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/81dc85a9-bc11-4320-a371-f72a3092f859> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/81dc85a9-bc11-4320-a371-f72a3092f859> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The regularity witness still needs a canonical, choice-free policy, because its AxiomRefs are hashed into the consumer's verdict identity." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/81dc85a9-bc11-4320-a371-f72a3092f859> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/81dc85a9-bc11-4320-a371-f72a3092f859> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
