<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/9b1b4487-1081-4c40-956b-0ba56ba19a41> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "No model is ever constructed, so realization, explanation and justification do not come for free — justification strategy stays an open question and arrives only at M4." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/beb2d24f-f318-4236-b855-26946b1484d8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/beb2d24f-f318-4236-b855-26946b1484d8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v0 answers TBox coherence plus assertion-driven clashes, not full OWL consistency — without equality and nominals there are OWL-inconsistent ontologies v0 cannot detect, which is why everything outside the encoding is out-of-profile rather than best-effort." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/beb2d24f-f318-4236-b855-26946b1484d8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/beb2d24f-f318-4236-b855-26946b1484d8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/beb2d24f-f318-4236-b855-26946b1484d8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-17T22:28:14.476821Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/beb2d24f-f318-4236-b855-26946b1484d8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "v0 answers TBox coherence plus assertion-driven clashes, not full OWL consistency — without equality and nominals there are OWL-inconsistent ontologies v0 cannot detect, which is why everything outside the encoding is out-of-profile rather than best-effort." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/bff5aeb4-45c6-4456-8621-1b903f9b1411> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/bff5aeb4-45c6-4456-8621-1b903f9b1411> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A merge sort over indices allocates O(n log n) temporary lists. Acceptable under no_arena_cap, but it makes the sort the front end's largest transient allocator and worth revisiting if GO-scale profiling says so." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/bff5aeb4-45c6-4456-8621-1b903f9b1411> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/bff5aeb4-45c6-4456-8621-1b903f9b1411> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/bff5aeb4-45c6-4456-8621-1b903f9b1411> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-22T20:48:36.107948Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/bff5aeb4-45c6-4456-8621-1b903f9b1411> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "A merge sort over indices allocates O(n log n) temporary lists. Acceptable under no_arena_cap, but it makes the sort the front end's largest transient allocator and worth revisiting if GO-scale profiling says so." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c824874d-835f-4689-a02b-9401f73f80b1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c824874d-835f-4689-a02b-9401f73f80b1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The sort is no longer the front end's largest retained allocator, which resolves the concern recorded against the top-down form. Allocation is now 2n index slots per sort call regardless of n's size." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
