<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f544fd5c-cdac-44a8-8aff-64dbd2042224> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-12T05:01:39.400742Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
