<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/0165b8ad-6735-4c1b-b8dc-970c9bc1b612> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-20T04:38:55.518196Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
